	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(802.0, 445.0, 330.0, 299.0)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">*Chapter 8. 8A: Corpus: move Content to Ignored so only Title is used. Select Rows: Named Entities contains (GPE). In the second Corpus, make Named Entities the only text feature; in Preprocess Text use only the Regexp tokenizer with the pattern [^,\s][^,]\* and untick Lowercase and Stopwords. 8B: Ollama needs a running server with llama3.1:8b pulled; connect ner-sentences to its NER widget yourself (it takes minutes). 8C: Preprocess Text with Lowercase ticked, compare with 8A, then untick Lowercase.*</text>
	</annotations>
